# PayFix AI 2.0

## Intelligent Payment Dispute and Refund Operations Platform

PayFix AI 2.0 is a self-directed UK-style Technical Business Analyst portfolio project focused on transforming digital payment dispute and refund operations.

The project demonstrates:

- Business analysis
- Technical systems analysis
- Agile delivery
- Scrum
- Kanban
- Jira
- Confluence
- Requirements engineering
- Process improvement
- API and data analysis
- AI-assisted automation
- Controlled AI agents
- Responsible AI
- Testing and UAT
- Release management
- Benefits measurement

The project is aligned with the UK Government Digital and Data Profession Business Analyst capability framework.

## Project status

Project initiation and delivery environment setup.

## Important note

This is a portfolio project using synthetic data and simulated delivery scenarios. It is not a live banking platform or a UK Government project.
